{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Or on a distant road.</b> It is pointed (with a patach under the het), to say: not that it was certainly distant, but that he was outside the threshold of the Courtyard for the entire duration of the slaughtering (Pesachim 93). The second pesach: matzah and chametz are with him in the house, and there is no Festival there, and the prohibition of chametz is only together with it in its eating (there 95)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:03.784261082Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}